@startuml
skinparam dpi 300
scale max 2000 width
title 08. Transaction Monitoring & Reconciliation

|Accounting/Finance|
start
:Filter Transaction Reports;

|Payment Gateway|
:Aggregate Transaction Data;

|Accounting/Finance|
if (Perform Reconciliation?) then (Yes)

  |Internal Wallet System|
  :Compare Internal vs. External Totals;
  note right
    Identifies "Missing" or "Duplicate"
    transactions between our system
    and the bank partner.
  end note
endif

|Accounting/Finance|
:Review Details & Export;

if (Anomaly Detected?) then (Yes)
  :Flag & Annotate Anomaly;

  |Internal Wallet System|
  :Save Audit Notes;
endif

|Accounting/Finance|
stop
@enduml